Dermavia · Dark Spots — Scratchboard Long Take (26 s, 1080×1920, 30 fps)

Product photo (assets/product.jpg): supplied by the client, Dermavia; used with their permission.
The carved carton and bottle labels are redrawn from that photo.
Dermavia name and "D" mark: the client's own brand.

Picture: made entirely in code (three.js r170, canvas 2D), rendered headless. No generated images, no stock footage.
Style: "Scratchboard Long Take" from the Lemo-Opuscar style library, print-pass and material techniques adapted.

Fonts (SIL Open Font License 1.1, texts in fonts/):
  Noto Naskh Arabic, Bold instance — Google Fonts, github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notonaskharabic
  Noto Serif, Bold instance — Google Fonts, github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notoserif
  Noto Sans, SemiBold and Regular instances (the pack's labels) — Google Fonts, github.com/google/fonts/tree/main/ofl/notosans

Music: original score, sampled instruments (CC0 1.0):
  VS Chamber Orchestra: Community Edition (Versilian Studios) — cellos, violins, contrabass, contrabass pizzicato, horn, timpani
  Versilian Community Sample Library (Versilian Studios) — harp, bowed vibraphone, glockenspiel

Sound effects: synthesised procedurally (knife cuts, seals, birds, the sun's shimmer, ink, the pack set down, paper tear). No recordings.
